| ---------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **LLMVoter**                 | Becomes the voting microservice inside Parliament.                                     |
| **Label-as-you-go Labeller** | Parliament can triage labeling queues (“which samples are ambiguous?”).                |
| **Social Sorter**            | When you’re ready, open the gates; users step into the same chambers the models built. |

In other words, *nothing* you’ve done is wasted—this is simply the **agent-only beachhead** that’s easiest to monetize first.

